---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | SoloKit" description="How SoloKit handles your data: the tools run in your browser and nothing you type is uploaded.">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted small">Last updated 13 October 2026</p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>SoloKit's tools run in your browser. The numbers, names and addresses you type into them are not sent to us or to anyone else.</p>

    <h2>What is stored on your device</h2>
    <p>The invoice generator and the time zone planner save your last entries in your browser's local storage, so the form is filled in when you return. This data never leaves your device. You can remove it with the "Start a new invoice" button, or by clearing your browser's site data.</p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like most web hosts, GitHub may record technical information such as your IP address when your browser requests a page, to keep the service secure and running. See GitHub's privacy statement for details.</p>

    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>SoloKit does not currently use analytics or advertising cookies. If that changes, for example to show ads that keep the tools free, this policy will be updated first and will list the providers used, such as Google, and how to opt out of personalised ads.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:saifsiddiqui1717@gmail.com">saifsiddiqui1717@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
